@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Iniciar sesión
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"user2","password":"user2"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Listar las tareas
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Obtener una tarea del conjunto inicial
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Crear una tarea
# @name createTask
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Enviar una petición desde ApiTUI"}

###
@taskId = {{createTask.response.body.$.id}}

### Actualizar la tarea creada
PUT {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Petición comprobada","isCompleted":true}

### Eliminar la tarea creada
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Comprobar el 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

### Consultar el contrato de la API
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
